# Run 389 evidence archive — only README.md, summary.txt, and .gitignore are tracked.
# All per-run artifacts contain absolute paths and ephemeral data and MUST NOT be committed.
# Generated identity material (roots, leaf certs, KEM secret keys), signed trust bundles,
# bundle-signing verification keys, node data dirs, logs, and metrics dumps are temporary and
# dev-only; only published-safe hashes and status lines appear in the tracked summary/README.
material/
node-data/
nodes/
logs/
data/
*.public.json
*.candidate.json
*.registercheck.json
*.err
*.log
*.out
*.cert.bin
*.kem.sk.bin
*.spec
*.hex
*.help.txt
trust-bundle.json
public-identity.json